  "description": "<p>The newest version of the import-export tool has some changes to the configuration file that it creates.  The current version looks something like this: </p>\n\n<p>mode: export<br/>\nexternal: true<br/>\npredicates: <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains</a><br/>\noverwriteTombstones: true<br/>\nresource: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/pcdm\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/pcdm</a><br/>\ninbound: true<br/>\ndir: /Users/westgard/Desktop/test<br/>\nmap: foo,foo/bar<br/>\nbinaries: true<br/>\nrdfLang: text/turtle</p>\n\n<p>The verification tool needs to act in a logical and appropriate manner on all these options.</p>",
